nd again he would have been  very clear on this is  his argument for the invasion of iraq  was based on what they thought was true  at the time different than what we talk  about with lies now but it's really  important to go back and study how you  can get it wrong and have consequences  that are that great and you also own  that too own it yeah yeah that's  self-accountability and own it but the  crucial thing is not own it to move on  and get to the next thing yeah but own  it and understand it and why that  mistake was made because he was obsessed  with vietnam and not repeating the  mistakes of vietnam right and yet that's  partially what people say happened with  iraq john dickerson thank you very much  glad to see you here at the table yes  great to be here
 

